{"poe":"task:update","id":"t11","description":"Execute must-not compliance audit against all 16 MN constraints (note: must-nots.md overview states 14 but enumerates 16 identifiers — audit must use the full enumerated list). Produces written audit checklist confirming pass/fail for each identifier: MN-SEC-01, MN-SEC-02, MN-SEC-03, MN-PRIV-01, MN-PRIV-02, MN-PRIV-03, MN-TRUST-01, MN-TRUST-02, MN-TRUST-03, MN-ARCH-01, MN-ARCH-02, MN-ARCH-03, MN-SCOPE-01, MN-SCOPE-02, MN-QG-01, MN-QG-02. Verification methods per must-nots.md: Network tab (MN-SEC-01), HTML source inspection (MN-SEC-02), source scan for eval/innerHTML (MN-SEC-03), DevTools Application storage (MN-PRIV-01), source scan for analytics/beacons (MN-PRIV-02), source scan for console/fetch with player input (MN-PRIV-03), gameplay test of invalid guess (MN-TRUST-01), DOM inspection for target word (MN-TRUST-02), two-guess state check (MN-TRUST-03), package.json + HTML script tags (MN-ARCH-01), file:// load test (MN-ARCH-02), deliverable file inventory (MN-ARCH-03), source for auth/login (MN-SCOPE-01), source for date-based word selection (MN-SCOPE-02), console error check across 4 browsers (MN-QG-01), duplicate-letter test vectors (MN-QG-02). artifactType: test. estimatedHours: 2. acceptanceCriteria: All 16 MN identifiers explicitly checked and marked PASS; any FAIL is a blocker before t12 review task. Auditor must NOT stop at 14 items."}
```

```json
{"poe":"task:update","id":"t6","description":"Implement renderRow(rowIndex, scoreResults) performing two distinct operations per tile: (1) tile.textContent = letter — sets letter content using textContent (not innerHTML) per MN-SEC-03; (2) tile.classList.add('correct'|'present'|'absent') — applies CSS color class for green/yellow/gray state. These are separate concerns; color state cannot be expressed through textContent. CSS classes 'correct', 'present', 'absent' must be defined in t1 (HTML skeleton) or t9 (responsive CSS) before this task can be marked done — implementing agent must verify their existence before proceeding. artifactType: code. estimatedHours: 1. acceptanceCriteria: Tiles display correct letter via textContent (MN-SEC-03 — no user input via innerHTML); tiles show green (#6aaa64) for 'correct', yellow (#c9b458) for 'present', gray (#787c7e) for 'absent' via classList; CSS classes 'correct'/'present'/'absent' confirmed present in stylesheet before task marked done."}
```

```json
{"poe":"done","summary":"Stage 1 plan for Wordle Clone created and approved: 3 Epics, 9 Features, 12 Tasks, 19 dependency edges. Reviewer APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS. Two conditions addressed inline: (1) t11 acceptance criteria updated to enumerate all 16 MN identifiers explicitly (not the self-contradicting stated count of 14 in must-nots.md); (2) t6 description clarified to require both textContent assignment for letters and classList manipulation for color state, with explicit prerequisite that CSS color classes exist in t1 or t9 before t6 is marked done. Plan is ready for execution."}
```

